### Authority retrieves a full dataset of a consignment (local platform)
GET {{RUUTER_URL}}/efti/api/v1/authority/dataset/EU-EE/mock/b24ebf37-a068-11f1-b8f0-3c9c0f2eb459
X-Request-ID: 327b4aea-a081-11f1-a87b-3c9c0f2eb459
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

> {%
  client.test("Local platform dataset", () => {
    client.assert(response.status === 200)
    // client.assert(response.headers['content-type'] === 'text/xml')
  })
%}

